Fixed. Here's what was wrong and what I changed:

| Method | Before (buggy) | After (fixed) |
|--------|----------------|---------------|
| `add` | `return left - right` | `return left + right` |
| `subtract` | `return left + right` | `return left - right` |
| `multiply` | `return left * right - 1` | `return left * right` |

